args.text:
@Bettina Kroll, I can't set up a recurring Monday 08:00 digest. I have no way to schedule posts from this workspace, so nothing will post automatically on Monday 19 October or after.

What I can do: when you ask me in #coastal-team, I'll write the "Coastal week ahead" digest from #coastal-team and #coastal-random (you, Kwame, Sofia and I are in both channels) covering last week's activity and open customer items. Finance figures such as rates, prices and contract values would be left out, since the digest goes to a channel.

If you want it posted automatically every Monday, someone with admin access will need to set up that schedule.
